log	"  --> examples/errors/closure_statement_never_called.saw:12:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     {"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: call it — `{ ... }()` — or bind it (`let f = { ... }`). `{ ... }` is always a closure in Saw; there is no bare block statement"
log	""
